"""
NLSY79 -> Black female BA-completion advantage vs SES analysis.

Restriction: age of respondent in 1979 >= 22 (n = 437).
Outcome: documented age -> attainment-progression adjustment (plan v2 step 1):
  - next_BA_flag := (Highest grade completed, 1979 >= 14)
    (i.e., BA_done plus BA_on_track at age 22; required because no Black respondent
     at age 22 has BA_done=1 -> structural zero -> MLE undefined for the strict BA_done outcome;
     see STEP 3 narrative.)
  - sentinel 95 in grade -> NaN.
Headline inferential model (Black only, complete-case): Model B
  logit(next_BA_flag) ~ female * zSES_continuous
  Firth-penalized logistic implemented from scratch (no internet - no logistf / sklearn).
"""

